      "auth": "none",
      "endpoint": "https://push2.eastmoney.com/api/qt/stock/get?secid={secid}&fields={fields}",
      "module": "src/lib/market-provider.ts",
      "usedBy": ["fetchLiveQuote", "getMarketSnapshot", "getMarketIndexSnapshot", "getMarketStockDetail"],
      "fallback": "tencent-quote",
      "timeoutMs": 3500,
      "health": {
        "url": "https://push2.eastmoney.com/api/qt/stock/get?secid=1.600519&fields=f43,f57,f58",
        "expectJsonPath": "data.f57",
        "referer": "https://quote.eastmoney.com/"
      },
      "notes": "免费公开接口，无 SLA；部分网络（如 WSL）会被掐断 HTTPS。停牌或盘前字段缺失时由 mock 补位，整条行情标为 mock。"
